.Sh HISTORY
.Fn X509_REQ_get_subject_name
is a function in OpenSSL 1.1.0 and a macro in earlier versions.
.Pp
.Fn X509_CRL_get_issuer
is a function in OpenSSL 1.1.0. It was previously added in OpenSSL 1.0.0
as a macro.
.Pp
.Fn X509_NAME_hash
was turned into a macro and deprecated in OpenSSL 3.0.
.Pp
.Fn X509_ACERT_get0_issuerName ,
.Fn X509_ACERT_set1_issuerName
were added in OpenSSL 3.4.
